  "verdict": "VERIFIED",
  "rationale": "The evidence explicitly states that the bank shall obtain a declaration about the local address within a period of 30 days and that the account shall be operated with specific conditions during the 30-day period pending verification.",
  "evidence_quote": "Provided that the bank shall obtain a declaration about the local address within a period of 30 days of opening the account and shall verify the said local address. Provided further that pending the verification of address, the account shall be operated with the condition that allows foreign remittances not exceeding USD 1,000 or equivalent into the account and a cap of ₹50,000 on aggregate withdrawal from the same, during the 30-day period."
